(the other stale roles' packages - directory-replica, policy-mirror, route-dns, already
stale at eab4cfac4 - are not this role's and were restored). Bundle sha256 4c25cde6d7f8c726
dc2d57f92cf47630f067a6086ee6893d8e57d50f9fb619f6 (1374197 bytes), manifest sha256 fa7403b5ef
2d2872a40f33b0d42510a9d20dee0d851b665223fb93efaa77ef98, byte-identical on a second build.
